            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625720/extras/3defa254cd1c727cac4f989707fac423.poster.avif?t=1683367097\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625720/extras/3defa254cd1c727cac4f989707fac423.webm?t=1683367097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625720/extras/3defa254cd1c727cac4f989707fac423.mp4?t=1683367097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Two friends, two stories, 71 years.</strong><br>Time is just a memory after all, subject to change. <strong>Like you</strong>.<br><br>A ~1 hour short narrative game that spans two lifetimes. Sometimes serious, sometimes funny, sometimes weird. Maybe heartbreaking.<br><br><strong>↦</strong> <i>Made by the writer of Still There, set to music by Abstraction</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625720/extras/41c930bb2195d2c8d1f9d906e2aa5a17.avif?t=1683367097\" width=600 height=67 /></span><br>Live the story of two friends and the secrets—the love, the pain, the quirks, the memories—that connect them, via a peculiar approach to storytelling that lets you <strong>pick dialogue choices for both characters</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625720/extras/f1df995ad5018795b21002dd4cff65b4.avif?t=1683367097\" width=600 height=67 /></span><br>Make it silly or funny or serious or raw or dramatic. <strong>Everything is real</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625720/extras/89c0c6624624e86543514cdcfc0cb24c.avif?t=1683367097\" width=600 height=67 /></span><br>After you finish the first story you will unlock the Encore. A sequel that is not truly a sequel, <strong>a story of a story.</strong>",
